title: "Pharmacogenomic Analysis of CYP2C19*2 and Its Impact on Clopidogrel Response"
authors:
  - family-names: Ghosh
    given-names: Soumojit
type: software
abstract: >
  A pharmacogenomic research project investigating the CYP2C19*2
  variant (rs4244285), its influence on clopidogrel metabolism,
  population allele frequencies, and clinical implications.
keywords:
  - Pharmacogenomics
  - CYP2C19
  - Clopidogrel
  - Population Genetics
  - Drug Metabolism
